  "name": "theme",
  "type": "registry:theme",
  "title": "KOC Theme",
  "description": "Kuwait Oil Company brand tokens for light and dark. Anchored to #0060A9, recovered from KOC's own stylesheets. Install this first — it re-skins a stock shadcn app into a KOC app.",
